{'symbol': 'SYY', 'date': '2021-12-06 08:00:00', 'title': 'SYSCO ANNOUNCES AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE THE COASTAL COMPANIES, A LEADING FRESH PRODUCE DISTRIBUTOR', 'text': "HOUSTON, DEC. 06, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- SYSCO CORPORATION (NYSE: SYY), THE LEADING GLOBAL FOODSERVICE DISTRIBUTION COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE THE COASTAL COMPANIES, A LEADING FRESH PRODUCE DISTRIBUTOR AND VALUE-ADDED PROCESSER, FROM CONTINENTAL GRAIN COMPANY. UPON COMPLETION OF THE TRANSACTION, THE ACQUISITION WILL OPERATE AS PART OF FRESHPOINT, SYSCO'S SPECIALTY PRODUCE BUSINESS. THE ACQUISITION WILL CREATE A STRONG FRESHPOINT PRESENCE IN THE MID-ATLANTIC REGION, PROVIDE SIGNIFICANT VALUE-ADDED MANUFACTURING CAPABILITIES AND FURTHER DIVERSIFY SYSCO'S PRODUCE SPECIALTY BUSINESS."}